sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Employee
  participant APP as Web app
  participant API as Server (API + services)
  participant DB as Database
  participant AG as AI agent
  U->>APP: Sign in
  APP->>API: Authenticate
  API->>DB: Verify credentials + load role
  API-->>APP: Session (httpOnly cookie)
  U->>APP: Manage partners (create, update, status)
  APP->>API: Partner operations
  API->>DB: Persist partner + status history
  U->>APP: Review partnership request
  API->>DB: Load request + compute rubric
  API-->>U: Decision (accept creates a partner)
  U->>AG: Ask an executive report
  AG->>API: Grounded, validated tool calls
  API->>DB: Query partners, projects, documents
  DB-->>AG: Real data + cited evidence
  AG-->>U: Report with charts, tables, PDF
